          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tomorrow may need adjusting"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Завтра может потребовать корректировки"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "明天可能需要做出调整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "coach.priority.tomorrowSPlanConflictsWithTodayS.2739": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tomorrow's plan conflicts with today's recovery state."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Завтрашний план конфликтует с сегодняшним восстановлением."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "明天的计划与今天的恢复计划相冲突。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "coach.priority.tomorrowSQualityDependsOnHowMuch.4607": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tomorrow's quality depends on how much recovery capacity you restore before then."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Качество завтра зависит от того, сколько ресурса вы вернете до этого."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "明天的质量取决于您在此之前能回收多少资源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "coach.priority.tonightDecidesHowMuchOfTomorrowS.1648": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tonight decides how much of tomorrow's plan is actually useful."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Сегодняшний вечер решит, какая часть завтрашнего плана действительно будет полезной."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今晚将决定明日计划中究竟哪些部分真正有益。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "coach.priority.topUpOnlyIfYouNeedIt.2270": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Top up only if you need it."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Добавьте только если действительно нужно."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在确有必要时方可添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "coach.priority.trainingIsPlannedAgainstAReadinessLimiter.2974": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Training is planned against a readiness limiter."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Тренировка запланирована на фоне ограничения по готовности."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次训练计划在备战受限的情况下进行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "coach.priority.trainingOnlyWorksIfYouCanAbsorb.2751": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Training only works if you can absorb it. Tonight's sleep, fuel, and fluids decide whether tomorrow is adaptation or just more fatigue."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Тренировка работает только если тело может ее усвоить. Сегодняшний сон, еда и вода решат, станет завтра сильнее или просто устанет еще больше."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "训练只有在身体能够吸收它时才会见效。今天的睡眠、饮食和水分摄入，将决定明天是变得更强壮，还是仅仅变得更加疲惫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "coach.priority.trainingReadiness.72": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Training readiness"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Тренировка готовность"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "训练就绪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "coach.priority.tryingToCompensateOftenAddsMoreFatigue.3816": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trying to compensate often adds more fatigue than value."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Попытка компенсировать часто добавляет больше усталости, чем пользы."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "试图弥补往往带来的疲惫感，反而比其益处更多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "coach.priority.turningEasyMovementIntoWorkStealsFrom.4383": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turning easy movement into hard work undercuts recovery."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Если превратить лёгкое движение в жёсткую работу, восстановление пострадает."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若将轻松的运动转变为高强度训练，身体恢复将会受到影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "coach.priority.underFuelingMattersMostWhenLoadTiming.3491": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Under-fueling matters most when load, timing, or tomorrow's plan makes it relevant."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Недостаток еды особенно важен, когда нагрузка, время или завтрашний план делают его значимым."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当压力、时间或次日计划使得饮食变得至关重要时，缺乏食物就显得尤为关键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "coach.priority.upcomingTraining.64": {
