    "highlights.story.foundRhythm.body": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recovery stayed steady because your sleep timing and training load were more consistent this month."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Восстановление оставалось стабильным, потому что сон и тренировочная нагрузка в этом месяце были ровнее."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复情况保持稳定，是因为本月的睡眠与训练负荷均更为均衡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "highlights.story.foundRhythm.headline": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've found your rhythm"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Вы нашли свой ритм"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你找到了自己的节奏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "highlights.story.recoveryResilient.body": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your recovery stayed steady despite lighter activity and uneven sleep. A few weaker days did not change the overall pattern."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Восстановление оставалось стабильным несмотря на меньшую активность и неровный сон. Несколько слабых дней не изменили общий паттерн."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尽管活动量减少且睡眠不规律，恢复情况仍保持稳定。数日状态欠佳并未改变整体恢复趋势。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "highlights.story.recoveryResilient.headline": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recovery stayed resilient"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Восстановление осталось устойчивым"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复 stayed resilient"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "highlights.story.rhythmNeedsAttention.body": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recovery, activity, and sleep moved lower this month. WeekFit is watching whether this is a short dip or a pattern that needs more recovery support."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Восстановление, активность и сон снизились в этом месяце. WeekFit отслеживает, это краткий спад или паттерн, которому нужна поддержка восстановления."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本月，恢复能力、活动量及睡眠时长均有所下降。WeekFit 正在监测这一短暂下滑或特定模式，该模式可能需要恢复支持。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "highlights.story.rhythmNeedsAttention.headline": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your rhythm needs attention"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Вашему ритму нужно внимание"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "您的节奏需要关注。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "highlights.story.sleepRecoveryUp.bodyFormat": {
      "comment": "Monthly highlight body. The argument is the sleep consistency increase percentage.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your sleep schedule became more consistent by %lld%%, helping your recovery stabilize and bounce back efficiently while training stayed steady."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Расписание сна стало стабильнее на %lld%%, помогая восстановлению стабилизироваться и эффективнее возвращаться к норме при ровной тренировочной нагрузке."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "睡眠规律性提高了 %lld%%，有助于身体恢复稳定状态，并在保持恒定训练负荷时更有效地回归正常生理状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "highlights.story.sleepRecoveryUp.headline": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recovery became more predictable"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Восстановление стало предсказуемее"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复情况变得更加可预测。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "highlights.story.trainingBackSeat.body": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "And it was likely the right call. Your recovery baselines dropped early in the cycle, and you naturally scaled back your activity volume to prevent burnout and protect your body."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "И, вероятно, это было правильным решением. Базовые показатели восстановления снизились в начале цикла, и вы естественно уменьшили активность, чтобы избежать перегруза и защитить тело."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这很可能是一个正确的决定。在你的周期初期，你的恢复基准值已出现下降，因此你自然而然地减少了活动量，以避免过度劳累并保护身体。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "highlights.story.trainingBackSeat.headline": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Training took a back seat this month"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Тренировки отошли на второй план в этом месяце"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本月的训练已退居次要地位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
